    {
      "id": "CVE-2026-77647",
      "publishedDate": "2026-08-20T22:24:39.626Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-08-20T22:24:39.626Z",
      "description": "SPIP before 4.4.20 allows unauthenticated remote attackers to execute arbitrary code, as exploited in the wild in August 2026. This is related to incorrect identification of <?php blocks, and var_export's mishandling of certain cases such as presence of a '<' character.",
      "severity": 9.8,
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：SPIP SPIP\n🔓 漏洞类型：Code Injection (CWE-94)\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
      "references": [
        {
          "url": "https://blog.spip.net/Mise-a-jour-critique-de-securite-sortie-de-SPIP-4-4-20.html",
          "type": "reference"
        },
        {
          "url": "https://lists.debian.org/debian-security-announce/2026/msg00359.html",
          "type": "reference"
        }
      ],
      "affected": [
        {
          "defaultStatus": "unaffected",
          "product": "SPIP",
          "vendor": "SPIP",
          "versions": [
            {
              "lessThan": "4.4.20",
              "status": "affected",
